      "id": "claim_ea40d97ad44e46498c549f6cff870409",
      "statement": "No compliant client-facing HMS interface exists in production; proposal FCT-1893 (Client-Safe Hold Status Facade), which would add GET /prsp/hms/v1/holds/{holdId}/client-view returning disclosure tier, approved copy key, and permitted client actions, was deprioritized in 2025-Q3.",
      "evidence": [
        {
