    {
      "id": "claim_3c120831807f4dddbc0a911384ba13a2",
      "statement": "CTRL-PAY-040 prohibits providing any client-facing estimate of hold release time for holds in disclosure tiers G or R, and sanctions-related blocks or rejections are communicated to clients exclusively by Sanctions Operations (not channels), with OFAC reporting under 31 CFR 501.603/501.604.",
