    {
      "id": "claim_0ecccdb7c3664181b7a6f6e6756ef45d",
      "statement": "CTRL-PAY-031, updated 2026-06 following pilot FCT-1951, allows HRC-01 (duplicate-suspect) holds to be resolved by client attestation through a digital channel with step-up authentication, up to $5,000,000, above which Wire Room release is still required; this applies only to HRC-01.",
