    {
      "id": "claim_07f4e6140cc64127afa207ca4643bb15",
      "statement": "The 2026-09-08 Payments ARB minutes set a firm PPH v1 sunset of no extension beyond 2027-03-31 (Volaris 9.6 removes the v1 adapter), after which the legacy holdReasonDesc confidentiality exception must be retired, with remaining v1 consumers required to present migration plans at the 2026-11-10 ARB session.",
